		{"id":"7871ea5c8c2ed31d","x":-440,"y":-200,"width":384,"height":178,"type":"text","text":"In this aera Askain began to grow as a city. Founded by Aldyria Askain It was a peaceful city who's denizens were mostly common folk and farmers. Over the course of the next several hundred years it went through many changes before become the Askain it is today"}
